cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use bancpipeline outputs, please cite the BANC paper."
title: bancpipeline
abstract: >-
  Data pre-processing pipeline for the BANC (Brain And Nerve Cord)
  connectome, including skeletonization, cross-dataset neuron matching
  (NBLAST + connectivity), axon-dendrite splitting, neuropil assignment to
  synapses, neurotransmitter and metric enrichment, and consolidated
  per-neuron metadata. Produces the analysis-ready data released alongside
  Bates, Phelps, Kim, Yang et al. (2026, Nature, open access).
type: software
license: GPL-3.0
url: "https://github.com/htem/bancpipeline"
repository-code: "https://github.com/htem/bancpipeline"
authors:
